@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = user@example.com
@password = Password123
@accessTokenCookie = COLE_AQUI_O_VALOR_DO_COOKIE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@refreshTokenCookie = COLE_AQUI_O_VALOR_DO_COOKIE_REFRESH_TOKEN
@metricsToken = COLE_SE_TIVER_METRICS_AUTH_TOKEN

### Health básico
GET {{baseUrl}}

### ======================
### AUTENTICAÇÃO
### ======================

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "name": "User Name"
}

### Login (gera cookies access_token e refresh_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Refresh de sessão (usa cookie refresh_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refresh_token={{refreshTokenCookie}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### ======================
### USUÁRIOS
### ======================

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Atualizar usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User Name Atualizado"
}

### ======================
### CATEGORIAS
### ======================

### Criar categoria
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentação",
  "description": "Gastos com comida",
  "color": "#FF5733",
  "icon": "utensils"
}

### Listar categorias
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Buscar categoria por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1

### Atualizar categoria
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Gastos com alimentação fora de casa"
}

### ======================
### TRANSAÇÕES (PROTEGIDAS)
### ======================

### Listar transações paginadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?page=1&limit=10
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Criar transação
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

{
  "title": "Salário Mensal",
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "type": "RECEITA",
  "date": "2026-04-21"
}

### Buscar transação por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Atualizar transação
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

{
  "title": "Salário Atualizado",
  "amount": 2600.00,
  "type": "RECEITA",
  "date": "2026-04-21"
}

### Deletar transação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### ======================
### ORÇAMENTOS (PROTEGIDOS)
### ======================

### Criar orçamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

{
  "amount": 1200,
  "month": 4,
  "year": 2026,
  "alertThreshold": 80,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Listar orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Status de orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/status?month=4&year=2026
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### ======================
### METAS (PROTEGIDAS)
### ======================

### Criar meta
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

{
  "title": "Reserva de Emergência",
  "targetAmount": 10000,
  "currentAmount": 2500,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-31"
}

### Listar metas
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Buscar meta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals/1
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Atualizar meta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/goals/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

{
  "currentAmount": 3000
}

### Deletar meta (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/goals/1
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### ======================
### RELATÓRIOS (PROTEGIDOS)
### ======================

### Resumo financeiro
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary?startDate=2026-04-01&endDate=2026-04-30
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Gastos por categoria
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/by-category?startDate=2026-04-01&endDate=2026-04-30
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Relatório mensal
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/monthly?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### ======================
### EXPORTAÇÃO (PROTEGIDA)
### ======================

### Exportar CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/export/csv?startDate=2026-04-01&endDate=2026-04-30
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Exportar PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/export/pdf?startDate=2026-04-01&endDate=2026-04-30
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### ======================
### BACKUP (PROTEGIDO)
### ======================

### Exportar backup JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/backup
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

### Restaurar backup JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/backup/restore
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessTokenCookie}}

{
  "version": "1.0",
  "data": {
    "transactions": [
      {
        "title": "Transação restaurada",
        "amount": 100,
        "type": "EXPENSE",
        "date": "2026-04-21T00:00:00.000Z",
        "categoryId": 1
      }
    ],
    "categories": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Alimentação",
        "description": "Gastos com comida",
        "color": "#FF5733",
        "icon": "utensils"
      }
    ],
    "budgets": [
      {
        "amount": 900,
        "month": 4,
        "year": 2026,
        "alertThreshold": 80,
        "categoryId": 1
      }
    ]
  }
}

### ======================
### OBSERVABILIDADE
### ======================

### Metrics (se METRICS_AUTH_TOKEN estiver configurado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{metricsToken}}